@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #A54A2E
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam classBorderColor #173A45
skinparam actorBorderColor #173A45
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #A54A2E
title Local deployment architecture - existing runtime configuration
node "User browser" as Browser
node "Local workstation / Docker Compose" {
 node "Frontend service\nVite :5173" as Web
 node "Backend service\nSpring Boot :8080" as API
}
database "Configured database" as DB
Browser --> Web : HTTP / React
Browser --> API : HTTP / cookie / allowed CORS Origin
API --> DB : JDBC / configured datasource
note right of DB
Local isolated tests use H2 or disposable PostgreSQL.
Shared runtime may use Supabase Session Pooler + SSL.
Compose does not start a database container.
end note
@enduml
